+<!doctype html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>SAMUHIA — Logo Studio</title>
+<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Schibsted+Grotesk:wght@400;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
+<style>:root{--bg:#F1EDE4;--sf:#FBF9F4;--tx:#0C1311;--mu:#5A625E;--bd:#D9D3C6;--pr:#0F6B54}*{box-sizing:border-box}body{margin:0;background:var(--bg);color:var(--tx);font:15px/1.55 "Schibsted Grotesk",Inter,system-ui,sans-serif}.w{max-width:1100px;margin:0 auto;padding:36px 20px 64px}h1{margin:0;font-size:28px;letter-spacing:-.5px}.sub{color:var(--mu);margin:4px 0 22px;max-width:680px}.tabs{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(6,1fr);gap:10px;margin-bottom:18px}.tab{background:var(--sf);border:1.5px solid var(--bd);border-radius:14px;padding:12px 8px;cursor:pointer;text-align:center;font:600 12px inherit;font-family:inherit;color:var(--tx)}.tab svg{width:48px;height:48px;display:block;margin:0 auto 6px}.tab.on{border-color:var(--pr);box-shadow:0 0 0 3px #0F6B5422}.pv{border-radius:18px;padding:44px;display:flex;justify-content:center;margin-bottom:14px}.pv svg{width:min(600px,100%);height:auto}.li{background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--bd)}.dk{background:#0B1210}.g{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:14px}.c{background:var(--sf);border:1px solid var(--bd);border-radius:16px;padding:20px}.c h2{margin:0 0 6px;font-size:14px}.c p{margin:0 0 12px;color:var(--mu);font-size:13px}button.b{font:600 12px inherit;font-family:inherit;border:1px solid var(--bd);background:#fff;border-radius:9px;padding:8px 12px;cursor:pointer;margin:0 6px 6px 0}button.m{background:var(--pr);color:#fff;border-color:var(--pr)}.ic{display:flex;align-items:flex-end;gap:14px;margin-bottom:14px}.ic svg{display:block}.sw{display:flex;gap:8px}.sw i{width:40px;height:40px;border-radius:9px;border:1px solid #0001}small{color:var(--mu);font-size:11px;display:block;margin-top:6px}@media(max-width:760px){.tabs{grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr)}.g{grid-template-columns:1fr}.pv{padding:22px}}</style></head><body><div class="w">
+<h1>SAMUHIA Logo Studio</h1><p class="sub">One logo family for the corporate site and its five products, built from the site’s own palette: deep green, amber, cream and near-black. Pick a brand to preview and export it.</p>
+<div class="tabs" id="tabs"></div><div class="pv li" id="pl"></div><div class="pv dk" id="pd"></div>
+<div class="g"><div class="c"><h2 id="nm"></h2><p id="why"></p><div class="sw" id="sw"></div><small>Primary · accent · text accent · ink</small></div>
+<div class="c"><h2>Downloads</h2><p>Wordmarks are outlined, so files look identical without fonts installed.</p><button class="b m" onclick="sv('L','lockup')">Logo SVG</button><button class="b" onclick="sv('D','lockup-reversed')">Reversed SVG</button><button class="b" onclick="pg('L',2048,'lockup')">Logo PNG</button><button class="b" onclick="pg('D',2048,'lockup-reversed')">Reversed PNG</button><button class="b" onclick="sv('Y','symbol')">Symbol SVG</button></div>
+<div class="c"><h2>App icon &amp; favicon</h2><div class="ic" id="ic"></div><button class="b m" onclick="sv('I','icon')">Icon SVG</button><button class="b" onclick="fav()">Copy favicon &lt;link&gt;</button><br><span id="sz"></span><small>16/32/48 favicon · 180 Apple touch · 192/512 PWA</small></div>
+<div class="c"><h2>Family rules</h2><p>Same tile shape and radius. Same stroke weight family. One symbol per product in its own site colour, with the amber spark shared across the family. Reversed lockup on dark only. Minimum lockup width 120 px, below that use the icon. Keep clear space equal to the symbol’s ring or arc thickness ×2.</p></div></div></div>
